OL,3,GNEWSATouring theatre show warns
OL,4,Achildren against vaping
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren as young as 11 are being
OL,7,Ftargeted by a theatre production
OL,8,Fdesigned to prevent them from taking up
OL,9,Fsmoking and vaping.
OL,11,FHooked, commissioned by Walsall Council
OL,12,FPublic Health, is touring up to 25
OL,13,Fsecondary schools across the borough
OL,14,Fthis month and next.
OL,16,FThe production, by Performance in
OL,17,FEducation, aims to help pupils in Years
OL,18,F7 to 9 understand the risks of nicotine
OL,19,Faddiction, challenge misconceptions and
OL,20,Frecognise the pressures that can lead
OL,21,Fpeople to try vaping.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
